1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/note/note-llm-from-scratch","children":["读书笔记丨《从零构建大语言模型》"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/note-llm-from-scratch.jpg","alt":"读书笔记丨《从零构建大语言模型》 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"读书笔记"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"读书笔记丨《从零构建大语言模型》"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"通过 500 行代码实现，深入解析从零构建 GPT 风格大语言模型的完整流程：从数据处理、Transformer 架构核心、训练循环到文本生成策略，带你理解大模型背后的工程实现原理。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-08-30T11:22:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/08/30"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","22,077"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["最近在看《从零构建大语言模型》这本书，跟着思路自己也动手码了一个基础款的 LLM，代码不多，拢共 500 来行，完整代码 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://github.com/hedon-ai-road/llm-from-scratch/blob/main/all_in_one.py","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://github.com/hedon-ai-road/llm-from-scratch/blob/main/all_in_one.py"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"llm-from-scrtach","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":63,"offset":62},"end":{"line":1,"column":79,"offset":78}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":62,"offset":61},"end":{"line":1,"column":155,"offset":154}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"llm-from-scrtach"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"所以，这篇读书笔记不打算空谈理论，就想换个方式：试着把这 500 行代码的来龙去脉讲清楚。通过解说代码，把从零构建一个大模型需要经历哪些环节、每个环节的目标和大概原理给串起来。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"笔者并非该方向的专业人士，很多东西不会讲得太深（我自己也不懂），所以很多时候都是点到即止。这篇文章更适合那些和我一样的开发者，希望能从一个接地气的工程角度，对大模型的构建原理有个宏观的了解。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["我们将采用一种贴近软件开发者思维的",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"代码执行流"}],"视角，从程序的入口 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"main"}]," 函数开始，顺着调用栈逐层深入，探究数据处理、模型构建、训练循环的每一个细节。当一个模块被调用时，我们便深入其中，直至最底层的实现。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"这趟旅程将遵循以下路线图："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["从 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"main"}]," 函数出发"]}],"：探寻程序的入口与总调度中心。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"深入数据流水线"}],"：看原始文本如何被加工成模型能够消化的食粮。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"解构核心引擎"}],"：层层剖析 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"GPTModel"}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"TransformerBlock"}]," 直至最深处的 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"MultiHeadAttention"}]," 机制。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"启动训练循环"}],"：见证模型如何通过损失计算和权重更新，从随机变得智能。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"见证文本生成"}],"：观察训练好的模型如何像我们一样，逐字逐句地\"思考\"和\"创作\"。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"让我们即刻出发，揭开大语言模型背后的代码之谜。"}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"1-数据准备与采样","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#1-数据准备与采样","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#1-数据准备与采样"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 数据准备与采样","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":4,"offset":734},"end":{"line":19,"