df:["$","pre","pre-30",{"data-language":"PYTHON","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-python","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"class"}]," ",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-title class_","children":"TransformerBlock"}],"(nn.Module):\n    ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"\"\"Transformer块：多头注意力 + 前馈网络 + 残差连接\"\"\""}],"\n    ",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"def"}]," ",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-title function_","children":"__init__"}],"(",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-params","children":"self, cfg"}],") -> ",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-literal","children":"None"}],":\n        ",["$","span","span-7",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"super"}],"().__init__()\n        ",["$","span","span-8",{"className":"hljs-variable language_","children":"self"}],".att = MultiHeadAttention(  ",["$","span","span-9",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# <----- 我们已经搞定了！"}],"\n            d_in=cfg[",["$","span","span-10",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"emb_dim\""}],"],\n            d_out=cfg[",["$","span","span-11",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"emb_dim\""}],"],\n            context_length=cfg[",["$","span","span-12",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"context_length\""}],"],\n            num_heads=cfg[",["$","span","span-13",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"n_heads\""}],"],\n            dropout=cfg[",["$","span","span-14",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"drop_rate\""}],"],\n            qkv_bias=cfg[",["$","span","span-15",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"qkv_bias\""}],"],\n        )\n\n        ",["$","span","span-16",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# <----- 接下来我们继续来解决后面的内容"}],"\n        ",["$","span","span-17",{"className":"hljs-variable language_","children":"self"}],".ff = FeedForward(cfg)\n        ",["$","span","span-18",{"className":"hljs-variable language_","children":"self"}],".norm1 = LayerNorm(cfg[",["$","span","span-19",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"emb_dim\""}],"])\n        ",["$","span","span-20",{"className":"hljs-variable language_","children":"self"}],".norm2 = LayerNorm(cfg[",["$","span","span-21",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"emb_dim\""}],"])\n        ",["$","span","span-22",{"className":"hljs-variable language_","children":"self"}],".drop_shortcut = nn.Dropout(cfg[",["$","span","span-23",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"drop_rate\""}],"])\n"]}]}]
e0:["$","p","p-132",{"children":["答案就藏在构成 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"TransformerBlock"}]," 的另外几个关键组件中。接下来，我们将把目光从注意力机制本身移开，去探索环绕在它周围的左膀右臂——",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"前馈网络 (FeedForward Network)"}],"、",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"层归一化 (Layer Normalization)"}]," 和",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"残差连接 (Shortcut/Residual Connections)"}],"，看看它们是如何协同工作，共同构成 Transformer 架构坚实可靠的核心处理单元的。"]}]
e1:["$","ul","ul-15",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"层归一化 (LayerNorm)"}],": 它的根本作用是",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"稳定训练过程"}],"。在数据经过复杂的注意力计算或前馈网络变换后，其数值分布可能会变得非常不稳定。层归一化就像一个调节器，在每个子层处理之前，都将数据拉回到一个标准的、易于处理的分布上，确保信息流的稳定。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"前馈神经网络 (FeedForward Network)"}],": 如果说注意力机制负责",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"融合"}],"来自上下文的信息，那么前馈网络则负责对这些融合后的信息进行",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"加工和思考"}],"。它是一个小型的、独立处理每个词元位置的神经网络，用于提取更高级、更抽象的特征，增加模型的非线性表达能力。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"快捷连接 (Shortcut/Residual Connection)"}],": 这是训练深度网络的关键技巧。它允许信息绕过某个处理层（如注意力或前馈网络），直接传递到下一层。这确保了即使在经过多达 12 层甚至更多的深度变换后，最原始的输入信息也不会完全丢失，同时极大地缓解了深度学习中的梯度消失问题，让深度堆叠成为可能。"]}],"\n"]}]
e2:["$","h4","h4-6",{"id":"242-使用层归一化进行归一化激活","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#242-使用层归一化进行归一化激活","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#242-使用层归一化进行归一化激活"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2.4.2 使用层归一化进行归一化激活","position":{"start":{"line":1205,"column":6,"offset":44158},"end":{"line":1205,"column":25,"offset":44177}}}]},"children":"2.4.2 使用层归一化进行归一化激活"}]}]
e3:["$","p","p-133",{"children":"一个深度神经网络就像一个多级信息加工流水线。数据（信号）在每一层都会被权重矩阵进行复杂的数学变换。当层数很深时，每一层微小的变化都可能被逐层放大。这会导致两个极端问题 ："}]
e4:["$","ol","ol-13",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"信号爆炸"}],"：某些层的输出值变得非常大，导致后续计算溢出，训练过程崩溃。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"信号消失"}],"：某些层的输出值变得非常小，接近于零，导致信息无法有效传递到更深层，模型学不到东西。 这两种情况统称为",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"内部协变量偏移 (Internal Covariate Shift)"}],"，它使得训练过程极其不稳定，就像在一条崎岖不平的山路上开车，油门（学习率）稍有不慎就会冲出赛道。"]}],"\n"]}]
e5:["$","p","p-134",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"第一性原理解决方案：强制信号标准化"}]}]
e6:["$","p","p-135",{"children":["最直接的解决方案，就是在信息进入每个核心处理单元（如注意力和前馈网络）之前，强制进行一次校准或标准化。",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"层归一化"}],"正是扮演了这个角色。 它的核心思想是，不管上一层传来的数据分布如何，它都强行将这批数据的均值调整为 0，方差调整为 1 。这相当于在流水线的每个关键工序前都安装了一个",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"稳压器"}],"，确保无论输入信号如何波动，进入工序的信号始终是稳定、标准化的。"]}]
