ef:["$","ul","ul-16",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"mean = x.mean(dim=-1, keepdim=True)"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"var = x.var(dim=-1, ...)"}],"：这两行代码计算了",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"每一个"}],"输入样本",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":["在其特征维度（",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"emb_dim"}],"）上"]}],"的均值和方差。",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"dim=-1"}]," 是关键，它指定了归一化是沿着特征维度进行的，而不是像批归一化（Batch Norm）那样跨批次进行。这使得 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"LayerNorm"}]," 的效果与批次大小无关，在处理可变长度序列时尤其稳定。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"norm_x = (x-mean) / torch.sqrt(var + self.eps)"}],"：这是标准的",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"标准化公式"}],"（减去均值，再除以标准差）。它将原始输入 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"x"}]," 转换为了一个均值为 0、方差为 1 的新向量 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"norm_x"}],"。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"self.eps = 1e-5"}],"：",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"eps"}]," (epsilon) 是一个极小的常数，它的唯一作用是",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"防止分母为零"}],"。如果某个样本的方差恰好为 0，没有 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"eps"}]," 就会导致除零错误，",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"eps"}]," 保证了计算的数值稳定性 1。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"unbiased=False"}],"：这是一个实现细节，表示在计算方差时分母是 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"N"}]," 而不是 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"N-1"}],"。选择 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"False"}]," 是为了",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"与原始 GPT-2 模型的实现保持兼容"}],"，因为其最初是使用 TensorFlow 实现的，而这是 TensorFlow 的默认行为 2。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
