15f:["$","ol","ol-23",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["状态切换 (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"model.eval()"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"model.train()"}],")"]}],"：这是评估流程的开关。",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"model.eval()"}]," 会关闭 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Dropout"}]," 等只在训练时使用的层，确保评估结果的稳定和可复现。评估结束后，",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"model.train()"}]," 会重新打开它们，让训练继续。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["隔离环境 (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"with torch.no_grad()"}],")"]}],"：这是为了确保评估的纯粹性。在这个代码块中，PyTorch 不会跟踪计算图和梯度。这不仅能防止任何意外的参数更新，还能大幅减少内存占用和计算时间，让评估更高效。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["委托计算 (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"calc_loss_loader"}],")"]}],"：",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"evaluate_model"}]," 将具体的计算任务委托给 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"calc_loss_loader"}],"。这个函数是一个通用的损失计算器，它迭代指定数量的批次，调用 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"calc_loss_batch"}]," 累加损失，最后返回平均损失。这种分层设计让代码更整洁。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"双重检验"}],"：同时计算",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"训练损失"}],"和",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"验证损失"}],"是至关重要的。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"训练损失持续下降，说明模型在努力学习。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"验证损失也随之下降，说明模型学到了普适的规律（泛化能力好）。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["如果训练损失下降，但验证损失开始上升，这就是",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"过拟合"}],"的信号，说明模型开始\"死记硬背\"训练题，而不是真正理解。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
