161:["$","p","p-207",{"children":"到目前为止，我们已经讨论了如何从数值上评估训练进展，并从头开始预训练了一个大语言模型。尽管样例中使用的大语言模型和数据集都相对较小，但这足以表明预训练大语言模型代价高昂。因此，保存大语言模型的参数非常重要，这样就不必每次使用它时都重新运行训练。"}]
162:["$","p","p-208",{"children":["这部分很简单，可以直接参考 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/saving_loading_models.html","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/saving_loading_models.html"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"PyTorch - Saving and Loading Models","position":{"start":{"line":1725,"column":16,"offset":63577},"end":{"line":1725,"column":51,"offset":63612}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1725,"column":15,"offset":63576},"end":{"line":1725,"column":124,"offset":63685}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"PyTorch - Saving and Loading Models"}]]}]
