169:["$","p","p-212",{"children":["前面我们在 2.6 章节已经介绍了使用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"generate_text_simple"}]," 进行最基本的文本生成了。本篇我们将介绍一个更具实际意义的文本生成函数 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"generate"}],"，它是 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"generate_text_simple"}]," 经过两种技术（温度缩放和 Top-k 采样）改进而来的。"]}]
