175:["$","blockquote","blockquote-8",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["因为关键的 Softmax 函数是非线性的，它会将 logits 被温度缩放后",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"减小的差值"}],"转换成更",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"平缓"}],"的概率分布，或将",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"放大的差值"}],"转换成更",["$","strong","strong-3",{"children":"尖锐"}],"的概率分布，所以最终结果会改变。"]}],"\n"]}]
176:["$","ul","ul-25",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["当 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"temperature"}]," > 1 (例如 1.5)"]}],"：",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"logits"}]," 会被缩小，使得不同词元之间的分数差距变小。经过 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Softmax"}]," 后，概率分布会变得更",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"平缓"}],"。这意味着，模型会降低对高概率词的执念，同时提升对低概率词的关注度，从而有更大的机会选择不那么常见的词。这会增加生成文本的",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"多样性和创造性"}],"，但过高则可能导致内容不连贯。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["当 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"temperature"}]," < 1 (例如 0.7)"]}],"：",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"logits"}]," 会被放大，使得分数差距拉大。",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Softmax"}]," 后的概率分布会变得更",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"陡峭"}],"。模型会更加确信那些它认为概率最高的词，降低选择其他词的可能性。这使得生成文本更",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"稳定和保守"}],"，更贴近训练数据的模式。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["当 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"temperature"}]," 趋近于 0"]}],"：这会极端地放大最高分数的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"logit"}],"，使得 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Softmax"}]," 的结果无限接近于 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"argmax"}],"，最终效果等同于贪婪解码。"]}],"\n"]}]
